  speakerName: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0fcb4f4247841f844a4ed3948dae66cf, type: 2}
  icon: {fileID: 0}
  portugueseText: "Marco e Rafael chegam no jornal. Entrando no escrit\xF3rio, tudo
    est\xE1 em chamas. Documentos de investiga\xE7\xF5es est\xE3o carbonizados, mas
    os poucos que escaparam do inc\xEAndio mostram crimes cometidos por militares
    em uma ditadura brutal, onde direitos humanos b\xE1sicos da popula\xE7\xE3o foram
    cerceados, e detratores s\xE3o perseguidos e ficam desaparecidos. "
  englishText: Marco and Rafael arrive at the newspaper office. Upon entering, they
    find everything in flames. Investigative documents are charred, but the few that
    escaped the fire reveal crimes committed by the military during a brutal dictatorship,
    where basic human rights were curtailed, and detractors were persecuted and disappeared.
